{"id":"611222","name":"迷迭香蒜粒煎法式羊排","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/611222/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"法式羊排","amount":"2根"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"一头"},{"name":"迷迭香","amount":"两根"}],"sub":[{"name":"黑胡椒牛排酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"法式羊排解冻。","img":"images/611222/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑胡椒牛排酱。","img":"images/611222/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜洗净切去头部，迷迭香。","img":"images/611222/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"挤上适量黑胡椒牛排酱。","img":"images/611222/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抓匀腌制30分钟。","img":"images/611222/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里适量橄榄油烧热，羊排，大蒜放进去。","img":"images/611222/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"两面煎至微微焦黄。","img":"images/611222/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入适量黄油，迷迭香，大蒜翻一下面。","img":"images/611222/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"两面煎焦黄即可。","img":"images/611222/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/611222/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/611222/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}